    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "George Rampersaud",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109336174362795517334/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDsZWHb-i8_13lX9WqD3TO9z-PRhJUTvw31ufz_V0Mfw3Zx3u7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "If you like Dunn's Famous, you're going to like this place!\nSuper friendly staff and great service!\nFree parking lot is a bonus!\n\nSmoke meat is good but it's expensive for what it is (hence the 4/5).\nBigger portions and a lower price and it's easily 5/5.",
        "time": 1754107420,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mimi the Travel Bee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117542156103217041817/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJufuwpf_TeMGCkA-nEYnaOLVii1vwkfQAGJxD8Nj6h7VDhyw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I recently went on a lunch date at this wonderful restaurant, and it truly exceeded all expectations. From the moment we walked in, I loved the welcoming atmosphere and the clean, well-maintained space. The staff was incredibly friendly and attentive, making us feel right at home from the start.\n\nThe food was fantastic. The smoked meat, in particular, was a highlight—it was perfectly seasoned, not too salty, and absolutely delicious. Every bite was a treat. The entire meal was great, but the service really stood out. The staff went above and beyond, ensuring our experience was seamless and enjoyable.\n\nIf you’re looking for a spot with delicious food and top-notch service, this is definitely the place. Whether for a casual lunch date or just to enjoy a great meal, I highly recommend it!",
        "time": 1725676263,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nicole Goulet",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103173631552029965951/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKYyeU7xE_mE4sl30RpYb1DBVGvnSHK_aq1zV13psqw6aANKQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Great smoked meat sandwich honestly didn't expect much since its a chain but it was really good!  Service was good and restaurant was clean.",
        "time": 1763726239,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Liz Potvin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117446006302534521920/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJXWm02DyUdOVdcCg2TnYkPgHb5lmh0u3Jo1ACv4RJhJkd0wwM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Sep/21/2023\nOur first time and we will definitely comeback. Food was great, very generous portions and great service, I guess it was a special night because there was a DJ and it gave a very nice atmosphere.\nOverall the staff was very friendly, the food was on point. The smoke meat sandwich (8oz) was quite delicious and the Classic Burger was very juicy.",
        "time": 1695342683,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jean-Marc Provencher",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107923672926173694482/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXExGYB_1rYRMm14xObJOLfVAuan0ryLjzheNySwBTId5woLIz9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Ordered on Uber Eats.\nDouble smashburgers and Clubs with fries. Burgers are very fresh and gooey. The Club is tasty and the portion is generous. Will definitely try the smoke meat sandwich the next time around!",
        "time": 1727392170,
        "translated": false
      }
